              "text": "حاكم — ḥākim — \"a governor; a ruler\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كان الحاكم عادلا مع الناس. kāna al-ḥākim ʿādilan maʿa an-nās. The ruler was fair to the people."
