            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "كان الشاعر يعمل في بلاط الملك. kāna ash-shāʿir yaʿmalu fī balāṭ al-malik. The poet worked at the king’s court."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "At home, بلاط (balāṭ) is floor tiles."
